INT. OPEN-PLAN OFFICE, SYNERGY HOLDINGS - DAY

Cubicles. Motivational posters. A broken ficus. A whiteboard reads: PIVOT TO JOY.

RAYMOND "RAY" FENNIMORE-SALAZAR (40s, vice president of Vibes, a lanyard of lanyards) claps his hands. DELPHINE OKAFOR-LUND (30s, tired, double-fisted coffee) watches from her desk. Next to her sits INTERN QUENTIN BOSCH (20s, tie from a high school dance).

RAY
Team! Quick sync.

DELPHINE
It's four-fifty-nine.

RAY
Perfect time for a sync!

QUENTIN
(whispering)
He means a meeting.

RAY
A circle-back! A deep dive! A moment of alignment!

DELPHINE
It's a Friday.

RAY
Friday is the new Monday.

He draws a giant circle on the whiteboard, then another, then a third. Delphine and Quentin stare, appalled.

RAY (CONT'D)
Who can tell me what this means?

QUENTIN
^Three circles.

DELPHINE
^Three circles.

They say it together. Ray points at them both, delighted.

RAY
Exactly! The Triple Loop!

DELPHINE
Ray.

RAY
Yes?

DELPHINE
I'm going home.

RAY
(crestfallen)
Is that a no on the loop?

She gathers her bag. Quentin, loyal, stays seated.

QUENTIN
I like the loop, Ray.

Ray beams. Delphine pauses in the doorway.

DELPHINE
Quentin. Run.
